<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">RRK52.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABAKOLOSAI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abakolosai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abakolosai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAKOLOSAI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Nyowe Paulo, entumwa ya Kristo Yesu, nk'oku Ruhanga yaakunzire, na Timoseo ow'eishe-emwe, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />twabahandiikira, imwe abarikwera n'ab'eishe-emwe abarikwesigwa omuri Kristo abari omuri Kolosai. Nitubendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusiima okwikiriza n'okukunda kwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Obutoosha ku tuba nitubashabira, tusiima Ruhanga, Ishe wa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:15">Efe 1:15</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuhurira eby'okwikiriza kwanyu oku murikwikiriza Kristo Yesu, n'okukunda oku mwine aha barikwera boona, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:18">Efe 1:18</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ebi mubiikiirwe omu iguru ebi mwineho amatsiko. Amatsiko ago mukagahuriraho ira omu kigambo ky'amazima g'engiri, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />eyaizire omuriimwe, nk'oku yaahikire omu nsi zoona, ekaana ebyana, ekeeyongyera, nk'oku kiri omuriimwe okuruga aha kiro eki mwahuririireho embabazi za Ruhanga, mukazeetegyereza omu mazima, <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />n'oku mwayegyesiibwe Epafufa, omuhuuku mugyenzi waitu orikukundwa. N'omuheereza omwesigwa wa Kristo ahabwaitu, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />kandi niwe yaatugambiire okukunda kwanyu oku mwine omu Mwoyo.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:15-17">Efe 1:15-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo naitwe, okuruga aha kiro eki twakihuririireho, titukarekaga kubashabira, nitweshengyereza ngu mwijuzibwe okumanya ebi akunda omu bwengye bwona obw'omwoyo n'okwetegyereza, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:27">Fil 1:27</ref>. </char></note> mugyende nk'oku aba Mukama bashemereire, nimumushemeza omuri byona, nimwana ebyana omu mirimo yoona emirungi, kandi nimweyongyera omu kumanya Ruhanga. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Mugumibwe n'obushoboorozi bwona, nk'amaani g'ekitiinisa kye oku gari, mubone kugumisiriza omuri byona n'okutaruha, mwine okushemererwa, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />nimusiima Isheboona, owaatuhindwire abashemereire kubagana n'abarikwera omugabo gw'obuhunguzi omu mushana. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:53">Luk 22:53</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Niwe yaatwihire omu butegyeki bw'omwirima, akatutaasya omu bukama bw'Omwana we ou akunda, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />ou twatungiiremu okucungurwa, nikwo kusaasirwa ebibi byaitu.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuba Omuhangi n'Omuteerani wa byona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:3">Heb 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ogwo niwe kishushani kya Ruhanga otarikureebwa, omujigaijo omu byahangirwe byona; <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yoh 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:10">10</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omuri Ogwo nimwo ebintu byona byahangiirwe, eby'omu iguru n'eby'ahansi, ebirikureebwa n'ebitarikureebwa, yaaba bitebe by'obugabe, nari obukama, nari obutegyeki, nari obushoboorozi byona niwe yaabihangire, kandi byahangwa kuba ebye. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:25-27">Enf 8:25-27</ref>. </char></note> Niwe yaabandiize ebintu byona, kandi omuriwe byona nimwo biteeranira. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:15">Efe 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Niwe Mutwe gw'omubiri, niyo kanisa; niwe butandikiro, niwe mujigaijo gw'okuruga omu bafu, ngu abone kuba ow'okubanza omuri byona. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:9">Kol 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Ruhanga akasiima ngu obwaruhanga bwe bwona bube omuriwe, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:13">Efe 2:13</ref>. </char></note> kandi ku yaaherize kureeta obusingye ahabw'eshagama ya Yesu aha musharaba, yaasiima ngu omuriwe ayegarurire byona, yaaba by'ahansi nari eby'omu iguru.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:18">Efe 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:10">Rom 5:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naimwe abaabaire bataanisiibwe ira na Ruhanga, kandi abazigu omu biteekateeko byanyu nimukora ebibi, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:27">Efe 5:27</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu Yesu abagarukaniise na Ruhanga omu mubiri gwe ogw'obuntu ahabw'okufa kwe, ngu abone kubamurika omu maisho ga Ruhanga, muri abarikwera abataine kamogo, kandi abatarikugaywa, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:14">Heb 3:14</ref>. </char></note> mwaba mugumire omu kwikiriza, mwombekirwe gye muhamire, mutarikutengyetsibwa, mutarikwihwa omu matsiko g'engiri, ei mwahuriire, kandi eyaagambiirwe ebihangirwe byona eby'ahansi y'eiguru, ei nyowe Paulo naagizirwe omuheereza waayo.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Mbwenu ninshemerererwa omu kubonabonesibwa kwangye ahabwanyu, kandi ebyatsigaire aha by'okubonabonesibwa kwa Kristo nibyo ndikuhikiiriza ahabw'omubiri gwe, niyo kanisa; <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:2">Efe 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:8">8</ref>. </char></note> ei naagizirwe omuheereza waayo, nk'obukuru obu Ruhanga yampaire ahabwanyu oku buri, okumanyisiza kimwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Rom 16:25</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 16:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:9-11">Efe 3:9-11</ref>. </char></note> niyo naama eyaasherekirwe okwiha ira ryona n'obusingye bwona, kwonka hati emanyirwe abarikwera be. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Nibo Ruhanga yaasiimire kumanyisa obutungi bw'ekitiinisa ky'enaama egi oku eri omu Banyamahanga; enaama egyo ni Kristo okuba omuriimwe, niwe matsiko g'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:13">Efe 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo niwe tugamba, nituhana omuntu weena omu bwengye bwona, ngu tumurikye omuntu weena ahikire omuri Kristo. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:7">Efe 3:7</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nikyo nyezirikira kukora, nindwana nk'obushoboorozi bwe oku buri, oburikunkoresa n'amaani.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okugumibwa obutungi oburi omuri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ahakuba niinyenda ku mumanya oku ndikubarwanirira munonga imwe n'aba Laodikea, n'abandi boona abatakandeebaga, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:18">Efe 3:18</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:19">19</ref>. </char></note> ngu emitima yaabo egumibwe, nk'oku barikuteerana hamwe omuri rukundo, baheebwe obutungi bw'okwetegyereza n'okumanyira kimwe enaama ya Ruhanga; n'enaama egyo niwe Kristo; <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />kandi omuri Ogwo nimwo obutungi bwona obw'obwengye n'okumanya busherekirwe. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Eki ninkigamba ngu hatagira omuntu owaabahabya n'ebigambo by'okubabeihabeiha; <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />ahakuba, n'obu ndaabe ntari naimwe omu mubiri, kwonka ndi naimwe omu mwoyo, ninshemerererwa kureeba obuteeka bwanyu oburungi n'okuhama kw'okwikiriza kwanyu omuri Kristo.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa n'okuzooka hamwe na Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:17">Efe 4:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, nk'oku mwayakiire Kristo Yesu Mukama, mube nikwo mwagyendera mutyo omuriwe, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:17">Efe 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:22">2:22</ref>. </char></note> mutsimbire emizi omuriwe, mwombekirwe omuriwe, kandi muhamiibwe omu kwikiriza, nk'oku mwayegyesiibwe, kandi muhingurane omu kusiima. <verse eid="COL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mwerinde, hatagira omuntu owaabanyagisa obwengye bw'abantu n'oburyarya obutaine mugasho, omu kukuratira emigyenzo y'abantu, n'okukuratira eby'okubanza eby'omu nsi egi, okutakuratira Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Yoh 1:14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omuriwe harimu Obwaruhanga bwona obureeberwa omu mubiri gwe; <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />kandi naimwe mwine amagara agahikire omuriwe, niwe Mutwe gw'obutegyeki bwona n'obushoboorozi bwona. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Rom 2:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuriwe mukasharwa okusharwa okutari kw'abantu, obu mwajuura omubiri gw'obuntu omu kusharwa kwa Kristo; <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref>. </char></note> kandi mukaziikwa nawe omu kubatizibwa, oku mwazookyeiremu nawe ahabw'okwikiriza okukora kwa Ruhanga owaamuzoire omu bafu. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1">Efe 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Naimwe, abaabaire bafeereire omu by'okushiisha byanyu n'omu kutasharwa kw'emibiri yaanyu, Ruhanga kabahindura abahuriire hamwe nawe, ku yaaherize kutusaasira eby'okushiisha byaitu byona, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:14">Efe 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:15">15</ref>. </char></note> yaaragaza ebihandiikirwe aha rupapura, ebyabaire nibitwomesereza nibiturega, yaarwihaho, yaarubamba aha musharaba; <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />kandi ku yaaherize kujuura eby'obutegyeki n'obushoboorozi, yaabihemura butunu, yaabisinguza ogwo musharaba.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwetantara emigyenzo etaine mugasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-12">Rom 14:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo hatarigira omuntu owaabacwera orubanja ahabw'eby'okurya nari eby'okunywa, nari eby'obugyenyi, nari eby'okuboneka kw'okwezi, nari sabato. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:1">Heb 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo n'ekishushani ky'ebiriija, kwonka amazima gaabyo gari omuri Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Hatarigira owaanyaga ebihembo byanyu ahabw'okubendeza okwecwendeeka nk'okwe n'okuramya baamaraika, ayegamiire ebi ayorekirwe, naayehimbisiza aha bwengye bwe bw'obuntu obutaine mugasho; <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:15">Efe 4:15</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:16">16</ref>. </char></note> haza atahamiire ha Mutwe, omu omubiri gwona guriisibwa, gukahamibwa hamwe emitsi y'engingo zaagwo, kandi gukakura omu kukura okurikuruga ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:9">Gal 4:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muraabe mwafiire na Kristo, mukareka eby'okubanza eby'omu nsi egi, ahabw'enki nimworobera emigyenzo nk'abakiri ab'ensi, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />ngu, Otarikwataho, Otarirozaho, Otarikoraho; <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:9">Mat 15:9</ref>. </char></note> (haza ebyo byona n'ebihwaho byaheza kuriibwa), mukakurata ebyaragiirwe abantu n'enyegyesa yaabo? <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:3">1 Tim 4:3</ref>. </char></note> N'amazima, ebyo nibishusha nk'eby'obwengye ahabw'okukundisa abantu emigyenzo y'ediini ei beegunziire, n'okwecwendeeka, n'okwesaasa omubiri; kwonka tibiine mugasho na kakye kuzibira okwetenga kw'omubiri.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ebishemereire abazookire na Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nu ku muraabe mwazoirwe na Kristo, musherure ebiri omu iguru, ei Kristo atuura, ashutami aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mat 6:33</ref>. </char></note> Mute omutima aha by'omu iguru, murekye eby'omu nsi; <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />ahakuba mukafa, kandi amagara gaanyu gasherekirwe na Kristo omuri Ruhanga. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:21">Fil 1:21</ref>. </char></note> Kristo amagara gaitu ku ariboneka, naimwe muryareebwa muri hamwe nawe omu kitiinisa.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:13">Rom 8:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mwite eby'ensi ebiri omu ngingo zaanyu, obushambani, ebihagaro, okurigira okubi, okwetenga okubi, kandi n'okwetenga, nikwo kuramya ebishushani. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:6">Efe 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo nibyo bireeta ekiniga kya Ruhanga aha batarikuhurira, <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />kandi naimwe mukaba mubigyenderamu, obu mwabaire mukibirimu. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25-31">Efe 4:25-31</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:4">5:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati mbwenu murekye n'ebi byona, okuguubwa kubi, ekiniga, eitima, n'okujumiirana, kandi omu kanwa kaanyu hatarirugamu ebigambo ebirikwitsa enshoni. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Mutaribeihana, ahakuba mukajuura omuntu owa ira n'emitwarize ye, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe 4:24</ref>. </char></note> mwajwara omuntu omusya, ohindurwa musya obutoosha omu bwengye kushushanisibwa n'Owamuhangire. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref>. </char></note> Aho tihariho Mugiriika n'obu yaakuba n'Omuyudaaya, oshazirwe n'otashazirwe, omunyamahanga, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N'eiziina ry'amahanga mabisi. </char></note>n'Omusikuusi, omuhuuku n'ow'obusingye, kureka Kristo ni byona, kandi ari omuri boona. <verse eid="COL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:32">32</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku muri abaatoorainwe Ruhanga, abarikwera kandi abarikukundwa, mujware omutima gw'esaasi, embabazi, okutwaza gye, obucureezi, n'okugumisiriza, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />nimugumisiririzana; kandi ku haraabe hariho oine eki arikufa na mugyenzi we, musaasirane; nk'oku Mukama yaabasaasiire, mube nikwo mwatwaza. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:8">Rom 13:8</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 13:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okwongyera ahari ebyo byona mujware okukunda, nikwo kukomerana byona bikakwatanisiza kimwe. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:7">Fil 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obusingye bwa Kristo obu mwayeteirwe nk'engingo z'omubiri gumwe, butegyekye omu mitima yaanyu. Kandi mube abarikusiima. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ekigambo kya Kristo kigume omuriimwe kikanye, mwegyesane, muhanane omu bwengye burungi bwona, nimweshongorera Ruhanga zaaburi n'ebyeshongoro n'ebyevugo by'Omwoyo, nimumuhimbisa omu mitima yaanyu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kandi eki muraagambe kyona, n'eki muraakore kyona, byona mubikore omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu, nimusiima Ruhanga Isheboona omuriwe.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize mirungi ey'amaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22-6:9">Efe 5:22—6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abakazi, mworobere baabaroimwe nk'oku kishemereire omuri Mukama. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Imwe abashaija, mukunde abakazi baanyu, murekye kubaitsa omwaga. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Imwe abaana, mworobere abazaire baanyu omuri byona; ahakuba ekyo nikyo kishemeza Mukama. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Imwe baishebo, mutagwisa kubi abaana baanyu, barekye kuhahaara emitima. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Imwe abahuuku, omuri byona mworobere bakama baanyu ab'omu nsi, mutabakorera ahabw'okureebwa nk'abarikwenda kusiimwa abantu, kureka mubakorere n'omutima ogutaine buryarya, nimutiina Mukama. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Kyona eki muraakore, mukikore mwihire aha mutima, nk'abarikukorera Mukama, kunu ti bantu; <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />nimumanya ngu Mukama niwe aribaha obuhunguzi, nibyo bihembo byanyu; ahakuba nimukorera Mukama waitu Kristo; <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />ahakuba orikukora kubi aryaihurwa ahabw'ekibi eki yaakozire; kandi Mukama tashoroora mu bantu.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:43">Lev 25:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abakama, muhe abahuuku baanyu ebihikire n'ebishemereire emirimo yaabo, nimumanya ngu naimwe mwine Mukama waanyu omu iguru.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwezirikire okushaba; omu kushaba kwanyu mugume nimureeba hamwe n'okusiima; <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:30">Rom 15:30</ref>. </char></note> kandi naitwe mutushabire Ruhanga atwigurire orwigi, tubone kugamba ekigambo ky'okumanyisa enaama ya Kristo, eki mboheirwe, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />nkimanyise nk'oku nshemereire kugamba. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:15">Efe 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 5:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Ab'aheeru mubagyendemu n'obwengye, murekye kufiisa busha omwanya. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:15">1 Pet 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Ebigambo byanyu bigume biri eby'embabazi, nk'ebirimu omwonyo, mubone kumanya oku mushemereire kugarukamu omuntu weena.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Efe 6:21</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyangye byona muryabigambirwa Tukiko, ow'eishe-emwe orikukundwa, omuheereza orikwesigwa, kandi mugyenzi wangye omu murimo gwa Mukama. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Eki naamubatumiraho n'okubamanyisa oku turi, kandi ngu agumye emitima yaanyu; <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10">Film 1:10</ref>. </char></note> naamutuma na Onesimo, ow'eishe-emwe omwesigwa orikukundwa, kandi mwene waanyu. Baryabateekyerereza byona ebiri kunu.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristariiko ou mbohirwe nawe yaabaramutysa, na Mako mwihwa wa Barunaba, (ou mwaragiirwe, ngu ku ariija, mumwakiire); <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />na Yesu orikwetwa Yusito yaabaramutsya. Omu bakozi bagyenzi bangye abu nkora nabo omurimo gw'obukama bwa Ruhanga, abo nibo bonka abaarugire omu bashazirwe, kandi bakampuumuza. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafura, mwene waanyu, yaabaramutsya; nawe n'omuhuuku wa Kristo Yesu, oyezirika obutoosha kubaijuka omu kushaba kwe, ngu mugume muri abahikire, kandi abarikumanyira kimwe byona ebi Ruhanga akunda. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ahakuba nimmuhamya ku akozire omurimo muhango munonga ahabwanyu n'ahabw'aba Laodikea, n'aba Hierapooli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tim 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Luka omufumu orikukundwa na Deema baabaramutsya. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mundamukize ab'eishe-emwe ab'omuri Laodikea, kandi muramutsye na Numfa n'ekanisa y'omu nju ye.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ebaruha egi ku eriheza kubashomerwa, eshomerwe n'omu kanisa eya Laodikea, kandi naimwe mushome egyo eriruga Laodikea. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Mugambire Arakipo muti: Oyezirikye ohitsye obuheereza obu waahairwe omuri Mukama.<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Nyowe Paulo naahandiika okuramutsya oku n'omukono gwangye. Mwijukye ku ndi omu kihome. Embabazi zigume naimwe.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>